{"text": "I prioritised **industrial accidents & toxic gas/oil leaks** (67-tonne ammonia leak in 2023, CPCL oil spill, thermal plant fly ash spills, and power plant fires), **cyclones and severe flooding** (Cyclones Michaung and Vardah, 2015 floods), and **urban/industrial fires**. \n\nTo assess readiness, I ran:\n- **`get_industrial_exposure` and `get_access('hospital')`** for industrial/chemical hazards: identifying 61 industrial and thermal power sites within 4.2 km (including fertilizer and foundry plants nearby), while finding critical health response gaps with 0% of residents within 2 km of a hospital (median walk 8.8 km).\n- **`get_flood_exposure`, `get_access('flood_refuge')`, and `get_nature_change`** for flood and coastal risks: revealing that 33.3% of blocks are low-lying, 95.5% of blocks lie within 500 m of water bodies (including flyash ponds and creek waters), and 425 low-lying residents lack flood refuge buildings within 300 m.\n- **`get_access('fire_station')` and `get_animal_facilities`** for emergency response and animal recovery: discovering a complete absence of local fire stations (median walk 12.7 km) and veterinary facilities (0 within 2 km, median walk 17.8 km) to support emergency response and animal welfare.", "tool_calls": [{"name": "get_area_profile", "args": {}}, {"name": "get_area_profile", "response": {"area": "Ennore", "centre": [13.2146, 80.3203], "radius_m": 1500, "blocks": 75, "blocks_with_satellite_data": 66, "residents_estimate": 14254, "residents_source": "WorldPop 2020 (modelled estimate)", "trees_share_2016_pct": 2.5, "trees_share_2025_pct": 8.8, "water_share_2016_pct": 45.7, "water_share_2025_pct": 43.7, "built_share_2016_pct": 38.8, "built_share_2025_pct": 40.7, "grass_share_2016_pct": 0.0, "grass_share_2025_pct": 0.0, "flooded_vegetation_share_2016_pct": 5.9, "flooded_vegetation_share_2025_pct": 2.2, "bare_share_2016_pct": 3.6, "bare_share_2025_pct": 1.6, "low_lying_blocks_pct": 33.3, "blocks_within_500m_of_water_pct": 95.5